era follows the car from behind as it escapes through the city.\n\n\n[Shot 2]\n\n4.00s - 7.00s\n\nCut to a separate cinematic reveal shot.\n\n<Subject 3> appears alone in a dark abandoned street away from the vehicle.\n\nThe camera shows a close-up of the alien creature.\n\nIts claws touch the wet ground.\nIts breathing creates a threatening atmosphere.\n\n<Subject 3> looks toward the distant sound of the approaching vehicle.\n\nAfter this reveal, the alien begins chasing <Subject 2> from behind.\n\nThe alien moves rapidly through the city streets, closing the distance with the red sports car.\n\n\n[Shot 3]\n\n7.00s - 11.00s\n\nContinue with the same <Subject 2>, the red sports car from the previous shots.\n\n<Subject 3> catches up with the vehicle from behind.\n\nThe alien jumps onto the rear roof section of <Subject 2> while the car continues moving forward at high speed.\n\nThe impact shakes the vehicle.\n\nInside the cockpit, <Subject 1> reacts with fear and urgency.\n\nShe looks upward as the alien claws damage the roof above her.\n\nThe camera alternates between:\n- close-up shots of <Subject 3> attacking the car roof,\n- <Subject 1>'s frightened reaction inside the vehicle,\n- exterior shots showing the alien on top of the same red sports car.\n\n\n[Shot 4]\n\n11.00s - 13.50s\n\nThe camera cuts to a distant skyscraper rooftop.\n\n<Subject 4> is positioned hundreds of meters away from the vehicle.\n\nShe lies in a stable sniper position and aims her rifle toward the highway below.\n\nThrough the sniper scope POV:\n\n<Subject 3> is clearly visible on the roof of <Subject 2>, the moving red sports car.\n\nThe scope view only shows the distant target.\n\nDo not show <Subject 4> inside the scope view.\n\nThe crosshair aligns with <Subject 3>.\n\n<Subject 4> fires one precise sniper shot.\n\nDo not show a visible bullet trail.\n\nOnly show the muzzle flash, rifle recoil, and the impact on the target.\n\n\n[Shot 5]\n\n13.50s - 15.00s\n\nThe shot hits <Subject 3>.\n\nThe alien loses balance and falls from the roof of <Subject 2>.\n\nShow <Subject 3> rolling away from the moving red sports car and falling onto the wet road.\n\nThe vehicle continues driving forward safely.\n\nThe final shot cuts back to <Subject 4> standing on the skyscraper rooftop holding the sniper rifle.\n\nShe calmly watches the city below as rain falls around her.\n\nEnd with a cinematic action movie ending."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [390.3923645019531, 604.49755859375], "pos": [-3514.369873046875, 5065.3310546875], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [453], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [261.63916015625, 344.7541809082031], "pos": [-1888.2803955078125, 5216.025390625], "widgets_values": ["6a9d477c0d2b7f8c8809452f879fa2196a2932b0c34c08aa4107ac0e6218430a.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 269, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [443], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [290, 330], "pos": [-2382.1748046875, 5247.8857421875], "widgets_values": ["d9e348c47913eb95870d4b4b9c671a8c55d08785fdecb7024c7897b4d98ec